WEBVTT

00:00:01.903 --> 00:00:03.534
ANOTHER YEAR GONE.

00:00:03.578 --> 00:00:06.319
AND NOW,
AS I UNDERSTAND IT,

00:00:06.363 --> 00:00:08.931
THE HOUSE CUP
NEEDS AWARDING,

00:00:08.974 --> 00:00:11.760
AND THE POINTS
STAND THUS--

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:13.370
IN FOURTH PLACE,

00:00:13.414 --> 00:00:16.199
GRYFFINDOR,
WITH 312 POINTS.

00:00:16.242 --> 00:00:19.420
[APPLAUSE]

00:00:19.463 --> 00:00:21.247
THIRD PLACE,

00:00:21.291 --> 00:00:22.988
HUFFLEPUFF,

00:00:23.032 --> 00:00:25.251
WITH 352 POINTS.

00:00:30.256 --> 00:00:34.043
IN SECOND PLACE,
RAVENCLAW...

00:00:34.086 --> 00:00:37.350
WITH 426 POINTS.

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:44.706
AND IN FIRST PLACE,

00:00:44.749 --> 00:00:47.622
WITH 472 POINTS,

00:00:47.665 --> 00:00:48.710
SLYTHERIN HOUSE.

00:00:48.753 --> 00:00:51.669
YEAH!
WHOO!

00:00:55.804 --> 00:00:58.284
NICE ONE, MATE.

00:01:02.071 --> 00:01:03.899
YES, YES.
WELL DONE, SLYTHERIN.

00:01:03.942 --> 00:01:05.378
WELL DONE, SLYTHERIN.

00:01:05.422 --> 00:01:10.819
HOWEVER, RECENT EVENTS
MUST BE TAKEN INTO ACCOUNT,

00:01:10.862 --> 00:01:16.477
AND I HAVE A FEW LAST-MINUTE
POINTS TO AWARD.

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:19.392
TO MISS HERMIONE GRANGER,

00:01:19.436 --> 00:01:22.787
FOR THE COOL USE
OF INTELLECT

00:01:22.831 --> 00:01:25.137
WHEN OTHERS
WERE IN GRAVE PERIL,

00:01:25.181 --> 00:01:27.009
50 POINTS.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:30.316
GOOD JOB.

00:01:37.846 --> 00:01:41.240
SECOND,
TO MR. RONALD WEASLEY,

00:01:41.284 --> 00:01:44.069
FOR THE BEST-PLAYED
GAME OF CHESS

00:01:44.113 --> 00:01:48.378
THAT HOGWARTS HAS SEEN
THESE MANY YEARS,

00:01:48.421 --> 00:01:49.814
50 POINTS.

00:01:54.166 --> 00:01:56.778
AND THIRD,

00:01:56.821 --> 00:01:59.041
TO MR. HARRY POTTER,

00:01:59.084 --> 00:02:04.350
FOR PURE NERVE
AND OUTSTANDING COURAGE,

00:02:04.394 --> 00:02:08.224
I AWARD GRYFFINDOR HOUSE

00:02:08.267 --> 00:02:09.791
60 POINTS.

00:02:17.973 --> 00:02:19.409
WE'RE TIED WITH SLYTHERIN!

00:02:19.452 --> 00:02:22.107
AND FINALLY,

00:02:22.151 --> 00:02:24.153
IT TAKES A GREAT DEAL
OF BRAVERY

00:02:24.196 --> 00:02:26.198
TO STAND UP
TO YOUR ENEMIES,

00:02:26.242 --> 00:02:30.202
BUT A GREAT DEAL MORE TO
STAND UP TO YOUR FRIENDS.

00:02:30.246 --> 00:02:35.991
I AWARD 10 POINTS
TO NEVILLE LONGBOTTOM.

00:02:49.352 --> 00:02:52.268
ASSUMING THAT
MY CALCULATIONS ARE CORRECT,

00:02:52.311 --> 00:02:55.750
I BELIEVE THAT
A CHANGE OF DECORATION

00:02:55.793 --> 00:02:57.665
IS IN ORDER.

00:03:03.322 --> 00:03:06.848
GRYFFINDOR
WINS THE HOUSE CUP.

00:03:08.806 --> 00:03:10.068
YES!

00:03:26.476 --> 00:03:27.695
NEVILLE!

00:03:41.012 --> 00:03:43.667
[TRAIN WHISTLE BLOWS]

00:03:44.886 --> 00:03:45.793
COME ON NOW.
